 asserts (default corner = title bar ≠ canvas; framed corner = canvas).\n\nStress-01..10 RE-MINTED at the full-bleed default (recipes unchanged; twins + end frames refreshed).\n\nStill open from take 1: rise vs fade · cover/tutorial · CJK/emoji tofu · commit the `code-png/` glyph rasters or keep them local?",
